{"id":"n15228-1-9","stage":2,"title":"뜰 · 院子","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n15228-1-9-1","ko":"한옥의 뜰이 매우 예쁘구나.","zh":"韩屋的庭院真漂亮啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"한옥의","meaning":"韩屋","explanation":"한옥：韩屋；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"한옥","audio":"/audio/13093e569b98afbcb7c9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"85586","senseId":"1","lemma":"한옥","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"뜰이","meaning":"院子","explanation":"뜰：院子；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"뜰","audio":"/audio/21fbbca3755e81a686ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15228","senseId":"1","lemma":"뜰","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"매우","meaning":"非常，极其，很","explanation":"매우：非常，极其，很","readings":[{"term":"매우","audio":"/audio/6226ddde2c49b372f0a1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61510","senseId":"1","lemma":"매우","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"예쁘구나.","meaning":"漂亮，好看","explanation":"예쁘다：漂亮，好看；구나：对新发现或新理解的情况表示感叹，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"예쁘다","audio":"/audio/f62ff8982d788e72028f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89697","senseId":"1","lemma":"예쁘다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"13093e569b98afbc","term":"한옥","zh":"韩屋","audio":"/audio/13093e569b98afbcb7c9.mp3","entryId":"85586","definition":"以韩国传统形式建造的房子。","pronunciation":["하ː녹"]},{"id":"21fbbca3755e81a6","term":"뜰","zh":"院子","audio":"/audio/21fbbca3755e81a686ef.mp3","entryId":"15228","definition":"房屋附带的空地。","pronunciation":["뜰"]},{"id":"6226ddde2c49b372","term":"매우","zh":"非常，极其，很","audio":"/audio/6226ddde2c49b372f0a1.mp3","entryId":"61510","definition":"表示远远超出了普通程度。","pronunciation":["매우"]},{"id":"f62ff8982d788e72","term":"예쁘다","zh":"漂亮，好看","audio":"/audio/f62ff8982d788e72028f.mp3","entryId":"89697","definition":"长相看起来美丽，让人喜欢。","pronunciation":["예ː쁘다"]}],"audio":"/audio/e35fbf010a92eb62375f.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n15228-1-9-2","ko":"그래, 여기서 사진 찍자.","zh":"对，咱们在这里拍照吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그래